<title>USA: Middlesex County, N.J., BANs won by BT Securities.</title>
<headline>Middlesex County, N.J., BANs won by BT Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>BT Securities said it won $25 million of Middlesex County, N.J., bond anticipation notes (BANs) with a net interest cost of 3.566 percent and a coupon of 4.70 percent.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
